      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Seek Prey",
      "category": "action",
      "placement": "bonusActions",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "bonus",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": null
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The bulette looks and sniffs around for new prey, releasing a satisfied, guttural chirp when it settles on one. One creature the bulette can see or sense within 30 feet of it and that can see or hear the bulette must make a DC 15 WIS save. On a failure, the target is frightened until the end of its next turn, and the bulette has advantage on the next attack roll it makes against the creature before the start of its next turn."
      ],
